sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Probe as Orchestrator probe
    participant Server as ManagementServer<br/>src/App/App.Host/Api/Management/ManagementServer.cs
    participant Check as Readiness check of a dependency

    Probe->>+Server: GET /health/live
    Server-->>-Probe: 200: the process runs
    Probe->>+Server: GET /health/ready
    loop every readiness check given, none in the base plateau
        Server->>+Check: check the dependency
        Check-->>-Server: ok, or an error
    end
    Note over Server: a failed check: WARN, and it is named in the answer
    Server-->>-Probe: 200, or 503 with the failed checks
    Probe->>+Server: GET /health
    Server-->>-Probe: the version and the state
